<title>JAPAN: Japan Transcity -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Japan Transcity -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 30.56		vs	   29.62</p>
<p> Operating	    1.27		vs	    1.36</p>
<p> Current		1.24		vs	    1.30</p>
